7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightMarkov3.lean#L105-L116","doc":"**`n = 3`, sign block.**  The general-`n` closed form reproduces the proved `markovWeight1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_rowLens_twoOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_rowLens_twoOne","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightMarkov3.lean#L92-L103","doc":"**`n = 3`, two-dimensional block.**  The general-`n` closed form reproduces the proved\n`markovWeight2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_rowLens_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_rowLens_three","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightMarkov3.lean#L78-L90","doc":"**`n = 3`, trivial block.**  The general-`n` closed form reproduces the proved\n`markovWeight0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_rowLens_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ocneanuWeight_rowLens_one","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/OcneanuWeightMarkov3.lean#L69-L76","doc":"The one-cell diagram: `w_{(1)} = 1`, the `n = 1` normalisation. ","signatureChunk":0}]}